# ---- Publication hygiene (added 2026-09-02, pre-publication audit) ----------
# Session and verification artifacts. Never committed: once the repo is public,
# every blob in history is permanent.
.playwright-mcp/
.impeccable/review/
.impeccable/build/
.impeccable/questions/
/*.png

# Agent/editor scaffolding. Deliberately not published: `.claude/skills/` and
# `.agents/skills/` are vendored THIRD-PARTY docs, and shipping other people's
# text under this repo's root FSL grant muddies a licensing posture this
# project treats as load-bearing. `skills-lock.json` IS committed so the
# ignored trees stay reproducible.
.claude/
.agents/

# Impeccable live-mode config: tooling settings for a tool that is not part of
# the product. No secret in it (the session token lives in the already-ignored
# live/server.json), but it is machine workflow config, not project docs.
.impeccable/live/

# Kept deliberately: .impeccable/design.json and .impeccable/surfaces/*.md are
# project documentation (the design system and its direction contract).
